OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA little rain at first in the
OL,6,Fsouth but this soon clearing to leave
OL,7,Fa dry and cold day. Cloudy in the
OL,8,Fsouth but brighter and sunnier spells
OL,9,Fin the north. Fresh easterly winds but
OL,10,Fstrong over the Western Isles.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly cloudy this evening,
OL,13,Fbut cloud soon clearing to leave long
OL,14,Fclear spells overnight. A cold, frosty
OL,15,Fnight with most places dry, though the
OL,16,Fodd shower may affect Caithness.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FThere is the chance of the
OL,19,Fodd shower, but otherwise it will be a
OL,20,Fdry day with variable cloud and bright
OL,21,For sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
