OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells Friday, the odd
OL,7,Fshower in the north possible. Dry with
OL,8,Fsome long sunny spells Saturday.
OL,9,FCloudier with a few showers Sunday.
OL,10,FCold with frosty nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
